flowchart TB
    subgraph Idea1["Architecture A - Static table"]
      F1[Bad scope yaml] --> R1[CI fails at build - fail loud]
      F2[Two skills claim same path] --> R2[Sort by ID - deterministic]
      F3[Whitespace only PR] --> R3[Skill still runs - wasted LLM]
      F3b[Cross-cutting PR fires 10+ skills] --> R3b[Sandbox batches - +30-90s latency]
    end
    subgraph Idea2["Architecture B - Classifier LLM"]
      F4[Picker times out] --> R4[Fall back to full static roster]
      F5[Prompt injection in diff] --> R5[Steers routing - REAL RISK]
      F6[Picker returns bad ID] --> R6[Drop and log audit]
      F7[Non-deterministic] --> R7[Same PR routes differently]
    end
    subgraph Idea3["Architecture C - Trigger graph"]
      F8[Diff fetch times out] --> R8[Fall back to path-only]
      F9[Regex too broad] --> R9[Wastes LLM budget]
      F10[Regex too slow] --> R10[100 ms per-trigger cap]
      F11[Tree-sitter fails on file] --> R11[Skip AST for that file]
    end
